cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "CBE: Coverage-Based Extrapolation for machine-learned interatomic potentials"
abstract: >-
  Coverage index and conformal calibration middleware that turns the training corpus of a
  machine-learned interatomic potential into a per-structure warning about whether a
  prediction is an interpolation or an extrapolation. One index per corpus serves every
  model trained on it; screening costs a single nearest-neighbour query and no reference
  calculation.
